{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_6000_situation", "source_sha256": "9b06ad93400b8090630c9bb7d6b1937603d4db72f0b69454709381fac91a4ef3", "ja": "雑誌の撮影前", "zh": "杂志拍摄前", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_6000_place", "source_sha256": "81de3ef798644173b3ce4e6242ca6dd94258a3a38c4206043a2cb54294caf17f", "ja": "キャンプ場", "zh": "露营地", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_6001_p", "source_sha256": "5ce0290617548cafd32cac5d300a5305b605468b4b7d87757b3963a98cd9aad3", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』のロケ。\nキャンプ場で、春香が犬と遊ぶ姿を撮る予定だ）", "zh": "（今天是写真杂志《偶像写真！！》的外景拍摄。计划拍摄春香在营地和狗狗一起玩耍的样子）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_6002_001har", "source_sha256": "e8603349bc78c6783412c8fb4c27317f54e82ca10c94cd26c90954ae12390a35", "ja": "わぁ～、いいお天気♪\nワンちゃんと思いっきり遊べそうですね！", "zh": "哇～天气真好♪\n感觉可以和狗狗尽情玩耍了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_6003_p", "source_sha256": "fbd12d3c323a2c6a60368714e3520441d47955365b2283c9db99794cf11ab095", "ja": "ああ。自然に囲まれて、\n犬もすごくご機嫌だったよな。", "zh": "是啊。被大自然包围着，狗狗也开心得不得了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_6004_001har", "source_sha256": "a5c2329568caba9795d813ed6cf69b35013b4616e5dd7f470037e327d133b311", "ja": "はい！　たくさんしっぽ、振ってましたもんね。\nとってもかわいかったです♪", "zh": "是呀！一直摇着尾巴呢。\n真的特别可爱♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_6005_001har", "source_sha256": "0b89f14b9853f185761d24731bb28c826bac654aa91eb8539b53890b20eea45f", "ja": "私、ワンちゃんのためにも、\n絶対に楽しい時間にしようって思ってます！", "zh": "我也是为了小狗，\n下定决心要让这段时间充满欢乐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_6006_p", "source_sha256": "52f2ce39b8463dff7928d59a26f542ff6763f0fe701914ddbb1950fd44d190fd", "ja": "そうだな。仕事としてはもちろん、\nいい思い出にもなるといいな。", "zh": "是啊。工作当然要做好，也希望能成为一段美好的回忆。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_6007_001har", "source_sha256": "47345a146da4c7e9f8f4f3a5255cc8af04122eb5a6a864cc5acb96e8db6b1455", "ja": "はい！　こうなったら、キャンプ場を全部回って……\nって、さすがにそれは難しいから……うーん。", "zh": "是！既然这样，那就把营地全部逛一遍……\n呃，不过那确实有点困难……嗯——。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_6008_001har", "source_sha256": "3f7f79a160c0c12f8bd31185362ac8c9c4ac3bd9e3f84f4493b0a555d4317587", "ja": "{$P$}さん、何をすれば、\nワンちゃんとの楽しい思い出が作れると思いますか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，你觉得做些什么，\n才能和小狗留下美好的回忆呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_6009", "source_sha256": "0a32320055d577e35a51facc83a19579585a4f429c134868bac886d5f0e90005", "ja": "バーベキューかな？", "zh": "是烧烤吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_6010", "source_sha256": "6c4b35d7035d2b8e9aa206f4a68fcc1ff3591fec542ccfc24a55510ecdaded3d", "ja": "アスレチック広場だ！", "zh": "是运动场！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_6011", "source_sha256": "72ec5f03d605b97baddeea44d984da2a650c186467c57e3c482d3a96e0572241", "ja": "海辺で遊ぼう！", "zh": "一起去海边玩吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_6100_p", "source_sha256": "ce199f291c070cd850f07192a3d38f5a9579085cd418a866853b645c96f68efb", "ja": "それなら、バーベキューはどうかな？　犬にも\n美味しいものを食べさせてあげれば、喜ぶと思うぞ。", "zh": "那样的话，去烧烤怎么样？也给狗狗吃点好吃的，我想它应该会很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_6101_001har", "source_sha256": "18b1fd646afff21b7653093110dd3dc1ead356fd970660e1f32d63bd897868a9", "ja": "わぁ、いいですね！　いい写真も撮れそうですし、\nワンちゃんとの仲も深まりそう♪", "zh": "哇，这个主意好棒！不仅能拍到好照片，\n感觉还能和小狗走得更近呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_6102_001har", "source_sha256": "0672ea4a59b8d9409c2f59ef32c5d2084d6908bc997441aebbd91e7bf06293df", "ja": "ワンちゃんは何が食べられるかな？\nふふっ♪　なんだかワクワクしてきました！", "zh": "小狗能吃什么呢？\n呵呵♪ 感觉莫名有些期待起来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_6200_p", "source_sha256": "8d07a9d99bf0c6f23d4c1f37aa143e9d5bfea22f0ee23aefd3c33982dc300374", "ja": "アスレチック広場に行ってみるのはどうだろう？\n犬用の遊具も設置しているらしいぞ。", "zh": "要不要去运动游乐广场看看？听说那里还设置了供狗狗使用的游乐设施。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_6201_001har", "source_sha256": "dcc757b57a7a6f2be9520b2755f4980f4a570c6b739c73d30fc0471d60871189", "ja": "えっ、本当ですか？　面白そうですね♪\nちょっと下見してきますっ。", "zh": "诶，真的吗？听起来很有意思呢♪\n我先去踩踩点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_6202_p", "source_sha256": "9a558cc6a20b1e591d538de98ad092f7e93ebcc2214b87fb1fa6bcfd272159c2", "ja": "あっ、春香危ないっ！　そこ、ぬかるんでるぞ！", "zh": "啊，春香小心！那里地面很泥泞！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_6203_001har", "source_sha256": "9a6637be86cc888658bff955bed564114262a751b96f943b127ba7fcc15d2b04", "ja": "え？　ぬか……ひゃあああぁぁっ！？　……っとっと！\nあ、アスレチックより、足元に気をつけないとですね。", "zh": "诶？泥……呀啊啊啊啊！？……哎呀呀！\n比起障碍设施，更得小心脚下才行呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_6300_p", "source_sha256": "6a16e7b4c4996f6d7e88bf8c6c4be1d270bf43ee3d25925e905310faad3e1ba0", "ja": "そういえば、向こうに海があったぞ。\n一緒に波打ち際を走ってみるのはどうだ？", "zh": "说起来，那边好像有海。\n要不要一起在海边跑跑看？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_6301_001har", "source_sha256": "c534cafaa63a2c5deb179eb32153651acee9446badc75bb843e23eb6ca63482b", "ja": "いいですね！　なんだか、映画のワンシーンみたい♪\n……あ、でも、衣装が濡れたらダメですよね。", "zh": "好呀！总觉得像是电影里的场景呢♪\n……啊，不过，把演出服弄湿了可不行吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_6302_001har", "source_sha256": "bdbf46b3d5948e49b859b7b7b0a4e331667611dfc3d8c3b3b4e96c6ed081a2e7", "ja": "もし、海辺で転んだりなんかしたらドロドロに……？\nうぅ～、急に不安になってきちゃいましたぁ……。", "zh": "要是在海边摔倒的话，会不会变得一身泥泞……？\n呜呜～，突然变得好不安啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_001har_6000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_001har_6303_p", "source_sha256": "6fc7eb284f642651071cb7aab1594a57d0659ece6b17f30f10f45c41b68ead0b", "ja": "す、すまん。春香が思いきり楽しめないのは\n良くないよな。もっといい案を考えてみるよ……！", "zh": "抱、抱歉。要是让春香没法尽情享受，那可不行。我会再想个更好的方案……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
